/**
 * @defgroup test_support_fake_memory fake_memory
 * @ingroup test_support_reference
 *
 * @brief Fake memory backend for unit tests.
 *
 * @details
 * Provides a deterministic test double for allocation-dependent code. Tests can
 * allocate memory from a fixed arena, inject allocation failures at configured
 * call indices, reset fake state, and detect leaks, invalid frees, and double
 * frees.
 */
